### measurements.http
### API tests for measurements

### Base query (pagination)
# Get page 2 with 10 records per page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?page=2&limit=10

### Filter queries
# By spec_id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?spec_id=dn25xen35

###
# By spec_name (fuzzy search, e.g., names containing "dn32")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?spec_name=dn32

###
# By is_compliant (1 for true, 0 for false)
# Get all non-compliant records
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?is_compliant=0

###
# By timestamp range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?startTime=2024-07-29T00:00:00Z&endTime=2024-07-29T23:59:59Z

### Sort queries
# Sort by average outer diameter descending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?sortBy=outer_avg&sortOrder=DESC

###
# Sort by average wall thickness ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?sortBy=wall_avg&sortOrder=ASC

### Combined query
# Get compliant records for spec_id 'dn20xen23', sorted by timestamp, page 1, limit 5
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?spec_id=dn20xen23&is_compliant=1&sortBy=timestamp&sortOrder=DESC&page=1&limit=5
```
